  {
    "name": "Exploring London with Nono",
    "subtitle": "Exploring Paris with you was some of the most fun I ever had. And I'm so happy that we continue to do this in London. You somehow made walking with no purpose or direction fun. I love walking and cycling, taking the train... anything with you ! My favourite part is when we choose the road that looks the most interesting, and go that way",
