    "subtitle": "One of my favourite trait of yours. I thought i was a little goofy , but you are on another level! I love how you make me happy and laugh just by being yourself. I sometimes catch myself doing the little goofy things that you do without thinking :) It makes me smile reminds me of you. Please never stop being like this, you are the sunshine and rainbows in my life , and in the lives everyone around you",
