  {
    "name": "The day I fell in love",
    "subtitle": "Our first date, in the jardin du Luxenbourg, It was a random tuesday, and you made it feel like a friday. I arrived thinking it will be another typical date, talking about normal typical stuff and then we would go home. But I was so wrong. I think i fell in love within the first 15 minutes. You have a way of making everything sound interesting and fun. It was the first time really speaking with you and we already had so many , varied and deep conversations, fun conversations, intellectual conversations, all while learning about each other. You are so good at this. This might be my favourite thing about you. I know im not the easiest person to talk to , i know i can be closed off or boring .. im not going to pretend im not. But somehow with you, I can speak my mind , i can say what i want and I love that so much. After, we ended up walking around randomly until it started getting dark, and it retrospectively this date was a perfect preview of everything we still do today! You are so unapologetically yourself , its so fking attractive and Im trying to learn to be like this!",
